      <dc:description>A view of the Vltava River, seen from a bridge, with a waterfall structure in the foreground. Large bridges span the wide waterway, while a long line of multi-story buildings forms the distant skyline. Industrial machinery and some small structures are visible near the weir.</dc:description>
