      <film:notes>Trips from my motorcycle trip to Prague, taking photos of brutalist architecture.</film:notes>
      <film:category>landscape</film:category>
      <film:visionRaw>A wide waterway flows beneath large stone arches spanning across. Industrial machinery and some small structures are visible near a low weir structure in the foreground. A long line of multi-story buildings forms a distant background along the far bank.</film:visionRaw>
